<title>CHINA: Korea First Bank opens Shanghai branch.</title>
<headline>Korea First Bank opens Shanghai branch.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's commercial bank, the Korea First Bank, opened its first Chinese branch in Shanghai, the Shanghai Securities News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It is the third branch of a South Korean bank in Shanghai, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Korea First Bank set up its Shanghai representative office in 1993 and has been involved in helping major South Korean companies invest in China, it said but gave no further details.</p>
</text>
